+4.3    A weak control with appropriately wide uncertainty
+
+The control uses log-one-plus character length and digit count of the original problem. Class-
+balanced logistic regression is fitted on all labelled Main-table rows, excluding every row with the
+held-out problem string in each leave-one-problem-out fold. Evaluation uses only labelled Small
+rows. The fixed decision threshold is 0.5, with no hyperparameter search or model-internal input.
